# Build context for the 13F Dashboard image. The Dockerfile copies an explicit
# file list, but excluding these keeps the context small (the archives alone
# are ~1 GB and data/ ~2 GB) and keeps derived caches out of the image.
*_form13f.zip
data/
artifacts/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/*.py[cod]
.github/
.git/
